<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine to issue T-bills on February 27.</title>
<headline>Ukraine to issue T-bills on February 27.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine's central bank will auction three-month, six-month, nine-month and 12-month discount treasury bills on February 27, the central bank said Thursday.</p>
<p>The issue volume of three-month T-bills was set at 7.5 million hryvnias.</p>
<p>The issue volume of six-month T-bills was set at 15 million hryvnias, of nine-month paper at 30 million hryvnias, while 40 million hryvnias' worth of 12-month T-bills will be issued.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
